Third-party material
--------------------

Fonts: Geist and Geist Mono (Vercel), bundled through the @fontsource-variable/geist and
@fontsource-variable/geist-mono packages. SIL Open Font License 1.1.

Icons: lucide icons (lucide-react). ISC licence.

Dictation model: the speech-to-text model is NOT part of this repository or of the app
bundle. It is downloaded at runtime, the first time dictation is enabled, from Hugging Face
(https://huggingface.co/handy-computer/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3-gguf, a GGUF conversion by the
Handy project of NVIDIA's parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3). The model card of that repository and the
card of the NVIDIA original (https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3) both state
the licence "cc-by-4.0" (Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode.en); the NVIDIA card adds: "Use of this
model is governed by the CC-BY-4.0 license". Attribution: Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3 by NVIDIA;
GGUF conversion by handy-computer. The file is checked against a pinned SHA-256 before use.

Other dependencies (npm and Rust crates) keep their own licences; see their packages.
